(The devastation of the war had fallen with especial severity upon Georgia.) Tj T*
(Worse still, the people seemed unable to repair the damage or to return to) Tj T*
(productive activity. Planters seemed unable to adapt themselves to the new) Tj T*
(economic conditions. Slavery, the system which they understood, was gone;) Tj T*
(they used the new system with little success, all the less because of the) Tj T*
