(than $100 the apprentice might complain to the court, which should then) Tj T*
(fix the amount.[33]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. A vagrancy law. Vagrancy was defined in the usual language of our) Tj T*
(criminal codes. The penalty was heavier than these usually provide,) Tj T*
