(vagrant might be fined or imprisoned at the discretion of the court, or) Tj T*
(sentenced to labor on the public works for not more than one year; or he) Tj T*
(might, at the discretion of the court "be bound out to some person for a) Tj T*
(time not more than one year, upon such valuable consideration as the court) Tj T*
(may prescribe."[34]) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Alterations in the penal laws. These alterations were of two) Tj T*
(contrasting kinds. The penalty for burglary in the night, arson, horse) Tj T*
