(slave, we next come to its attitude toward the fallen Confederacy and) Tj T*
(toward the federal government. And with reference to this subject the) Tj T*
(following facts are to be noticed:) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Almost the first act of the constitutional convention was to vote a) Tj T*
