(crime, at first included men of the best character and of the highest) Tj T*
(standing.[128] Thus reconstruction, together with its written laws, had) Tj T*
(produced conditions which made the net Humanitarian results doubtful, at) Tj T*
(least for the moment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(For the Republican Politicians reconstruction did not produce in Georgia) Tj T*
