(the new constitutions by the plan of inaction. This risk should be) Tj T*
(avoided, since the adoption of a state constitution probably meant the) Tj T*
(election of a Republican state government, and hence of Republican) Tj T*
(Senators, as well as Republican Congressional Representatives and) Tj T*
(Republican Presidential Electors in November, 1868. These advantages would) Tj T*
(be lost if the new constitutions were defeated. Therefore, by an act which) Tj T*
