(practice, at first supported and led by good men of the higher class,) Tj T*
(simply for defence, soon fell into the hands of the poor white class, the) Tj T*
(criminal class, and the turbulent and discontented young men of all) Tj T*
(classes, and became an instrument of revenge, crime and oppression. The) Tj T*
