(misdemeanors. This mode of punishment was the natural product of the) Tj T*
(transition from the old social conditions, when the negroes were) Tj T*
(disciplined by their masters, to the new conditions.[173] But besides) Tj T*
(these acts of correction many outrages were committed upon negroes, and) Tj T*
