(northern state, and that statements to the contrary were invented for) Tj T*
(political purposes.[177] The number was, indeed, greatly exaggerated by) Tj T*
(Republicans, as some of the Republicans themselves admitted.[178] Making) Tj T*
(allowance for the warping of the truth in both directions, and considering) Tj T*
