(some of the Democrats,[180] remembering also the recent disbandment of the) Tj T*
(army and the disturbed conditions of society, we must conclude that the) Tj T*
(attacks on negroes, made by disguised bands and otherwise, were very) Tj T*
(numerous.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
