(Georgia had failed to comply with the requirements of the Omnibus Act, and) Tj T*
(so was not yet entitled to representation in Congress. The failure here) Tj T*
(referred to was not that alleged by Bullock--that the members of the) Tj T*
(legislature had not taken the Test Oath--but the failure of the two houses) Tj T*
(to exclude persons disqualified by the Fourteenth Amendment. The Omnibus) Tj T*
(Act had provided that Georgia should be entitled to representation in) Tj T*
(Congress when her legislature had "_duly_" ratified the Fourteenth) Tj T*
(Amendment. The word _duly_ meant _in a certain manner_--namely, the manner) Tj T*
(required by the rest of the act. The failure to exclude the disqualified) Tj T*
(members was a departure from this manner.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
