(were not advanced very far, are worth noticing.[194] Their titles indicate) Tj T*
(the purpose "to enforce the Fourteenth Amendment." Now, the Fourteenth) Tj T*
(Amendment consists principally of prohibitions on states; it could not be) Tj T*
(enforced in Georgia unless Georgia was a state. Georgia had \(it was) Tj T*
(assumed\) admitted to her legislature men subject to the disqualifications) Tj T*
