(preceding session, but adding this clause: "That the legislature shall) Tj T*
(ratify the Fifteenth Amendment before Senators and Representatives from) Tj T*
(Georgia are admitted to seats in Congress." In accordance with its) Tj T*
(different legal basis the bill was entitled: "An act to promote the) Tj T*
