(     representation in Congress, and Senators and Representatives shall be) Tj T*
(     admitted therefrom ... and then and thereafter the preceding sections) Tj T*
(     of this act shall be inoperative in said state.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Hence, the military authority, said Bullock, would continue in Georgia) Tj T*
