() Tj T*
(The attitude of the convention toward the military authorities was most) Tj T*
(cordial. On December 20, a reception was given to Pope. The general made a) Tj T*
(speech and received an ovation.[269] Resolutions of friendship and) Tj T*
(gratitude were voted him on his departure.[270] Meade, on his arrival,) Tj T*
